# DPP/BW music expansion (CyanSMP64 fan pack import) — sample binaries committed directly as pre-compressed build artifacts.
# These are imported as-is from CyanSMP64/pokeemerald music_expansion_dev branch and don't have corresponding .wav source in this repo.
!sound/direct_sound_samples/bw_*.bin
!sound/direct_sound_samples/dp_*.bin
!sound/direct_sound_samples/hg_*.bin
!sound/direct_sound_samples/pl_*.bin
!sound/direct_sound_samples/purenoise.bin
!sound/direct_sound_samples/puresquare_*.bin

# Pokemon Clover 1:1 engine-level port (Keksandra + Stump battle themes).
# Bytecode .s extracted via custom disassembler from Clover ROM; sample .bin and wave .pcm extracted from Clover's voicegroup tree.
!sound/direct_sound_samples/clover/clover_*.bin
!sound/songs/midi/mus_clover_*.s

# Streamed PCM song samples (Xenon's Colress + F27 Tyrell's Urayne battle themes).
# Real B2W2 / Pokemon Uranium audio encoded as raw 8-bit mono at 21024 Hz.
!sound/direct_sound_samples/colress_stream.bin
!sound/direct_sound_samples/urayne_stream.bin
!sound/songs/midi/mus_b2_vs_colress.s
!sound/songs/midi/mus_uranium_vs_urayne.s
